    "description": "Fairly is a startup company with the goal to connect looking employers to people seeking employment while also\neliminating implicit bias within the hiring process.\n-Provided employers the ability to create education requirements for their job listings by building database tables\nand stored procedures in SQL, and creating the service controller in C#/.NET.\n-Informed admins of how users were led to their site by creating database tables and stored procedures,\ncreating the service controller, and designing a user friendly UI for the users to interact with.\n-Created a space for users and admins to upload podcasts by making all of the needed database elements, a\nservice controller in C#/.NET and a UI that is used to view upload and delete content\n-Participated in daily stand ups to inform senior developers of progress and any blockers that may be hinder\nprogressing.\n-Conducted code talks to communicate with leadership, daily and weekly production.\n-Performed and received peer code reviews to give and get suggestions based on naming conventions and\nproper casing ensuring everything is within industry standards while writing code.",
